Progress from mathematical foundations to advanced security analysis.

* Stage 1 — Boolean foundations

    TRUE, FALSE, AND, OR, NOT and truth tables.

* Stage 2 — Advanced Boolean operators

    XOR, NAND, NOR, XNOR and implication.

* Stage 3 — Boolean algebra

    Identity, domination, complement, distributive, associative, commutative, absorption and De Morgan's laws.

* Stage 4 — Mathematical logic

    Predicate, propositional, modal, temporal and fuzzy logic.

